Package: zls
Version: ZLS_VERSION-BUILD_VERSION~DIST
Architecture: DEB_ARCH
Depends: zls-0
Description: Language server for the Zig programming language
 zls is the Zig Language Server: completion, go-to-definition, diagnostics,
 inlay hints and formatting for Zig, spoken over the Language Server Protocol
 and understood by any editor with an LSP client.
 .
 This is a meta package. It pulls in zls-0, the build for the Zig 0.x series.
